Package: procedural-visualizer-tool
Architecture: any
Depends:
 hicolor-icon-theme,
 shared-mime-info,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: procedural animation editor and renderer
 Procedural Visualizer Tool creates seamless looping animations from layered
 procedural artwork. It provides a Qt desktop editor, music-responsive timing,
 reusable motion paths, project history, PNG and EXR frame export, and the
 pvt-render command-line renderer.

Package: libproceduralvisualizertool5
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: procedural animation rendering library
 This package contains the shared rendering library used by Procedural
 Visualizer Tool and compatible third-party applications.

Package: libproceduralvisualizertool-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libpng-dev,
 libproceduralvisualizertool5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for Procedural Visualizer Tool
 This package contains the public C++ header, unversioned library link, and
 CMake package metadata for applications using the procedural renderer.
